e tips, I am going to start shoe shopping now.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"trigurl3@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1227578221,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212860.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"panther","Id":212860,"Name":"panther","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a79ca7f35fce292dc93277ed90963d99","RawContent":"This is a great list! I feel good, cause I&#039;ve been doing all of these things. Although we are going w\/ the real flowers. With the cost of checked bags now we can&#039;t bring everything w\/ us. We need those checked bags for necessities, and now I looked and to check an additional bag, is $200!!!!! And I don&#039;t trust shipping. So i guess I will really just cut costs elsewhere and take my flowers and centerpieces!","Attachments":[],"Id":538333,"PostDate":1229736578,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                This is a great list! I feel good, cause I've been doing all of these things. Although we are going w\/ the real flowers. With the cost of checked bags now we can't bring everything w\/ us. We need those checked bags for necessities, and now I looked and to check an additional bag, is $200!!!!! And I don't trust shipping. So i guess I will really just cut costs elsewhere and take my flowers and centerpieces!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Photo by <\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.dlweddings.com\">www.dlweddings.com<\/a><br><br><span>My Planning Thread<\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t46588<\/a><span>My Wedding Review w\/ Lots of Pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48352<\/a><span>Our TTD pics<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445\">http:\/\/bestdestinationwedding.com\/forum\/t48445<\/a><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jacilyn.m.gannon@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1212474600,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209727.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Jacilynda","Id":209727,"Name":"Jacilynda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"baaa88336d72a77f204855ddf8811a13","RawContent":"Wonderful post! Thanks!","Attachments":[],"Id":538340,"PostDate":1229737010,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Wonderful post! Thanks!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissa.ayotte@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.27.238.196","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1169962920,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207103.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"~Melissa~","Id":207103,"Name":"~Melissa~","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b305ea2341fe439d654cf5569dafb92","RawContent":"Just a suggestion to add to your list...\n \n &lt;strong&gt;Wedding dresses\/bridesmaid dresses\/MOB and MOG dresses dont have to come from a bridal store!&lt;\/strong&gt; \n \n My wedding dress is actually an Alfred Angelo bridesmaid dress that they are doing in white (spent less than $200 that way!)\n \n My bridesmaids picked out beautiful dresses online for about $40 each! \n \n MOB &amp;amp; MOG found dresses on clearance in the formal department of Macys...\n \n I think we paid less than $500 for all 5 dresses! Gotta love that! &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Pinkie\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Pinkie\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Pinkie\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":538342,"PostDate":1229737384,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just a suggestion to add to your list...<br \/> <br \/> <strong>Wedding dresses\/bridesmaid dresses\/MOB and MOG dresses dont have to come from a bridal store!<\/strong> <br \/> <br \/> My wedding dress is actually an Alfred Angelo bridesmaid dress that they are doing in white (spent less than $200 that way!)<br \/> <br \/> My bridesmaids picked out beautiful dresses online for about $40 each! <br \/> <br \/> MOB & MOG found dresses on clearance in the formal department of Macys...<br \/> <br \/> I think we paid less than $500 for all 5 dresses! Gotta love that! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Pinkie\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Pinkie\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/pinkie.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Pinkie\" class=\"inlineimg\" \/><\/span>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>,<\/span><br><i>Tati<br><\/i><br><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEUN0g410600MTQ3NjE4b3wwMTU2c3xVbnRpbCBJIGJlY29tZSBoaXMgTVJTIQ.gif\">http:\/\/ticker.7910.org\/as1cEUN0g4106...aXMgTVJTIQ.gif<\/a><strong>24 booked! Woo Hoo!<\/strong><\/div><\/div>","Email":"tprice@gaylordhotels.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1211929241,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-209606.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":75,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tchuchuca","Id":209606,"Name":"tchuchuca","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":28118,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b00e518968ffd72a96870031d42c7445","RawContent":"Great Thread! Is $10,00 your budget of everything? I would love to see samples of what you have so far, especially the stuff from VistaPrints.\n \n I&#039;m freaking out over my budget right now. I thought this thing would cost me 10K-12K but after doing my budget, I&#039;m at 19K. FH is going to freak when he sees that.","Attachments":[],"Id":538349,"PostDate":1229738073,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Great Thread! Is $10,00 your budget of everything? I would love to see samples of what you have so far, especially the stuff from VistaPrints.<br \/> <br \/> I'm freaking out over my budget right now. I thought this thing would cost me 10K-12K but afte